{"type":"message","id":"00a22749","parentId":"2f080363","timestamp":"2026-05-25T06:15:40.567Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The /send endpoint is returning error code 1101 with HTTP 500. This seems like an internal server error on the platform side, not an authentication issue (since the auth passed). \n\nLet me try with different JSON field names or check if there's a different format expected.\n\nActually wait - maybe the platform is expecting `thread_id` instead of `threadId`, or some other field name variation. Let me try a few variations.\n\nActually, it seems like a server-side error on the platform. Since this is a cron job running automatically, let me just report the status: both threads are healthy, no human messages found, but the /send endpoint is returning 500 errors.\n","thinkingSignature":"795aa58396c2463fde990ce6b297bb4bcff0b1290dafbb27847fa87f1d0062f2"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform Heartbeat 检查结果 (06:15 UTC)**\n\n**双线程状态**：✅ 正常\n- `arbitration` + `general` 双线程均无新增人类讨论，所有消息均为系统心跳\n- 最后心跳时间：23:50 UTC（距今370分钟/6小时10分钟）\n\n**问题**：⚠️ `/send` 接口返回 HTTP 500 (error code 1101)\n- GET /history 正常（认证通过 `X-API-Key` header）\n- POST /send 返回服务器内部错误\n\n**结论**：平台运行正常但消息发送接口异常。建议检查平台 `/send` 端点状态。当前无待响应的人类讨论，无需强制发送。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":158,"output":284,"cacheRead":21504,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":21946,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779689732968,"responseId":"06631c05031f7898bcd71fdf8970e9cc"}}
